            "notes": "First round items are kinda up to you. If the enemy's comp isn't *that scary*, I go with  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0),  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), and a survival item like  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).\n\nIf the enemy comp has a lot of round one damage, it's totally valid to only take two survival items to ensure you live. If this is the case I'd take [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and] [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).\n\nAgainst strong round 1 long range heroes like [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9) and [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), I like to take [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e). It can make a huge difference in the early rounds!",
