            "notes": "### IF YOU WIN ROUND 1:  \nSell [Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089) and [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) in exchange for [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) (we take a weapon power item here because we don't have our AP powers yet)! If you have leftover cash you can pick back up the two green items you sold. If you're RICH RICH, you can sell all the green items to try to pick up  [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88).\n\n### IF YOU LOSE ROUND 1:\nPrioritize [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e)! I don't think I'd recommend selling any green items to get [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88), unless you're built different. ;3\n\n### REMEMBER HER AP SCALES WITH WHAMBULANCE AND FIRST RESPONDER. FOCUS ON WEAPON POWER AT LEAST UNTIL YOU GET WHAMBULANCE ROUND 3.",
