            "created_at": "2025-09-01T22:29:30.003493+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where the AP scaling begins! You can sell  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) unless you want to build more hybrid.\n\n## A TIP ABOUT WHAMBULANCE:\nSo the healing boost you give when you GA to someone does not go off until you hit space or crouch. If you don't and simply just GA to someone, it *will* go off, but it'll be very delayed. \nYou can abuse GA + space/crouch over and over again (especially when you get more cooldown on your GA) to nonstop burst heal your team mates.\n\n### IF YOU WON: \nBuy [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb)! If you don't have enough you can sell your last green item. If you still don't have enough, pick up [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and spend your extra cash on any of the green items you sold earlier! Or if you're RICH RICH, you can buy both Mark and Nano Cola.\n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nIf you have enough for [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) go for it, but don't sacrifice any blue items! You can substitute it with Nano Cola or basically any blue ability item, or any of the green items from earlier. Don't get discouraged! Your power spike is soon. :3",
