            "notes": "Ok this is where we should start having fun!\n\n### IF YOU WON: \nBuy [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)! This round and next round is where the cooldown reduction happens :D\n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nThink about the enemy team and what stats they have. Are you dying on cooldown? Sacrifice Long Distance Wings for a survival item like [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) or [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) depending on if they're running a lot of AD or AP. The point of this build is to be UNKILLABLE, so it's okay to sacrifice a little bit of AP/CDR to make sure you live!",
