            "notes": "### FOR YOUR THIRD POWER: \n [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) scales off AP, and this is a sneaky rez build, so GET IT! \n\nIf you don't want to try for risky rezzes, take [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4). If you're dying a lot I recommend  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1). \n\n### IF YOU WON: \nIf you chose to take [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) or  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) as a third power, The top three epic items are our priority. So now you should buy [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)! Congrats! You now have 35% AP and 30% CDR. It's time to become the flying rat! :D \n\nIf you chose to take [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) and are going a more rez-focused build, you can prioritize  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) over  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). We can pick that up next round!\n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nTry to catch up on the build by purchasing any purple items you haven't yet from the previous rounds.",
