            "notes": "### IF YOU WON: \nIt's time to finish up the build! Pick up anything you left out from the last rounds. I would prioritize depending on what third power you got like I said last round. Our CORE items are [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb),  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98), and [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e). \n\nWe also want to keep [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) because it scales well with  [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), but if you find you're not benefitting from it then it's okay to sell.\n\n__If you already have all three of the core items, what you get next depends on your playstyle.__\n- If you want to go for risky rez plays and have [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d), get [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f)!\n- If you'd rather play it safe, I HIGHLY recommend [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). You can also get [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4), [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) or [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5).\n\n### IF YOU LOST: \nIf you need more survivability, any of the items I marked as optional earlier are still a good idea, or you can even buy an epic survival item such as [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) or [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c). Just try to have as much AP and CDR as possible!",
